and. Its risk: with batches of around 265 units, an arrival plus leftover stock can exceed the 288 capacity when demand is weak.\n- **5** (about ×1.22) has a lot of safety stock. The downside is extra holding and large final orders that end up as worthless leftovers.\n- **0** (about ×1.08) has moderate safety stock.\n- **4** matches candidate 1 for product 0 but orders product 1 low (about ×0.93), which loses on penalties.\n- **7** and **3** sit close to forecast (×1.03 and ×1.0), which is below the best level given how expensive shortages are.\n- **6** is weakest because of the daily ordering fees.\n\nMy expected top four is 1, 2, 5, 0, with 4 the main contender to displace 0 or 5."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5048, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5048}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T09:08:51.491Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWGLjtfihgTJ1fK89g5H"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Jg94WzLckHbDDfHUNnSHBZ", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWGLk93R5nfnWpXkug9x", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Jg94WzLckHbDDfHUNnSHBZ", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.5, 0.75, 0.7, 0.15, 0.45, 0.55, 0.05, 0.3]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "